  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo - M&amp;E - Economic Analysis - Non-allocated Funds activity: Due Diligence funding is used to obtain sufficient information to evaluate, assess and appraise projects during program development, effectively oversee and monitor program implementation, conduct quality assurance, and then evaluate the results of the project once complete. In this particular project, due diligence funds were used to hire external technical assistance and/or collect data to support the design and implementation of the MCA&apos;s Economic Analysis frameworks , through program implementation and evaluation stages.</narrative>
  </description>
